content:
The bad rows in `invoices` all have VAT ≈ 6.67× the amount (e.g. 1157.31 / 173.6 ≈ 6.67), which looks like a rate of 667% instead of 15%. All three were created at t=491–499, after the v1.1 deploy at t=473. The ledger only shows one because only ORD-01003 has been synced yet. The corruption clearly originates in invoice-agent, not sync-job.

No further investigation needed.

